{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>If he afflict.</b> Now as for the punishment: if one afflicts and there is no helper, the punishment falls upon all of them. Therefore it follows with: and My anger shall wax hot and I will kill you, all of you. And it says <b>if he cry out at all to Me.</b> Concerning the orphan — and the same judgment applies to the widow. Only the orphan may perhaps be young and not know how to speak like the widow."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:26.177157059Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}